  "_what_this_is": "Route registrations in services/api (server.js plus src/**/*.js), keyed by first path segment. Ratcheted DOWNWARD ONLY: the total and every prefix may grow, never shrink. Built to make the planned server.js split verifiable -- after moving a route group into src/*.js the totals must be identical.",
